@startuml activity_create_reservation
title Activity — Create reservation (UC2)

(*) --> "Select car"
--> "Enter name, email, date range"
--> "POST /reservations"
--> "Find or create User by email"
--> "Check availability (UC7)"
if (Available?) then (yes)
  --> "Create reservation (DRAFT)"
  --> (*)
else (no)
  --> "Return 409 Conflict"
  --> (*)
endif

note right
  This activity shows the optimistic flow where availability
  is checked only against CONFIRMED reservations.
end note

@enduml
